---
import CalculatorLayout from '../../layouts/CalculatorLayout.astro';
---

<CalculatorLayout
  title="Personal Loan Calculator – Calculate EMI & Total Interest"
  description="Estimate your monthly loan payment, total interest, and repayment schedule based on your loan amount, interest rate, and repayment term."
  category="Finance"
  calculatorName="Personal Loan Calculator"
  slug="loan-calculator"
  keywords={[
    'personal loan calculator',
    'navy federal personal loan calculator',
    'discover personal loan calculator',
    'sbi personal loan calculator',
    'hdfc personal loan calculator',
    'icici personal loan calculator',
    'axis bank personal loan calculator'
  ]}
>
  <div class="space-y-6">

    <!-- QUICK PRESETS BAR -->
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 bg-white p-3.5 shadow-2xs dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 text-xs">
        <span class="font-bold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 mr-1 flex items-center gap-1">
          <span>⚡</span> Quick Presets:
        </span>
        <button type="button" class="btn-ln-preset rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-blue-500 hover:text-blue-600 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 cursor-pointer" data-amt="500000" data-rate="12" data-term="5" data-extra="0">💸 Standard 5-Yr (₹5L @ 12%, 5 Yrs)</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn-ln-preset rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-blue-500 hover:text-blue-600 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 cursor-pointer" data-amt="200000" data-rate="11" data-term="2" data-extra="0">⚡ Short-Term 2-Yr (₹2L @ 11%, 2 Yrs)</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn-ln-preset rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-blue-500 hover:text-blue-600 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 cursor-pointer" data-amt="1000000" data-rate="10.5" data-term="7" data-extra="0">👑 Large 7-Yr Loan (₹10L @ 10.5%, 7 Yrs)</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn-ln-preset rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-2.5 py-1 font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:border-blue-500 hover:text-blue-600 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 cursor-pointer" data-amt="500000" data-rate="12" data-term="5" data-extra="2000">💰 Prepayment (₹5L + ₹2k/mo Extra)</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- MAIN CALCULATOR FORM CONTAINER -->
    <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/90 bg-linear-to-br from-white via-slate-50 to-blue-50/30 p-5 shadow-xl shadow-slate-900/5 dark:border-slate-800 dark:from-slate-950 dark:via-slate-950 dark:to-blue-950/20 sm:p-7">
      
      <div class="border-b border-slate-200/80 pb-3 dark:border-slate-800">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>💸</span> Personal Loan Calculator
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          Estimate your monthly loan payment, total interest, and repayment schedule based on your loan amount, interest rate, and repayment term.
        </p>
      </div>

      <form id="form-ln" class="mt-4 space-y-4" novalidate onsubmit="return false;">
        
        <!-- ROW 1: PRIMARY LOAN INPUTS -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-4">
          <!-- Loan Amount -->
          <div>
            <label for="inp-ln-amt" class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Loan Amount (₹)</label>
            <input type="number" id="inp-ln-amt" value="500000" step="10000" min="1" class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white p-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-white" placeholder="5,00,000" />
          </div>

          <!-- Annual Interest Rate -->
          <div>
            <label for="inp-ln-rate" class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Annual Interest Rate (%)</label>
            <input type="number" id="inp-ln-rate" value="12" step="0.25" min="0" max="40" class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white p-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-white" placeholder="12.0" />
          </div>

          <!-- Loan Term & Unit -->
          <div>
            <label for="inp-ln-term" class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Loan Term</label>
            <div class="mt-1.5 flex rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800">
              <input type="number" id="inp-ln-term" value="5" step="1" min="1" max="30" class="w-full rounded-l-xl border-0 p-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 focus:ring-0 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-white" placeholder="5" />
              <select id="sel-ln-term-unit" class="rounded-r-xl border-l border-slate-300 bg-slate-50 px-2.5 text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-900 dark:text-slate-300 cursor-pointer">
                <option value="years" selected>Years</option>
                <option value="months">Months</option>
              </select>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Optional Start Date -->
          <div>
            <label for="inp-ln-start-date" class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Loan Start Date</label>
            <input type="month" id="inp-ln-start-date" class="mt-1.5 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white p-2 text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-white" />
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- QUICK TERM BUTTONS BAR -->
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50/70 p-2.5 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900/60 text-xs">
          <span class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 font-bold flex items-center gap-1">
            <span>⏱️</span> Popular Loan Tenures:
          </span>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1">
            <button type="button" class="btn-ln-quick-term rounded-md border border-slate-300 bg-white px-2.5 py-0.5 font-bold text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-300 cursor-pointer" data-years="1">1 Year</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn-ln-quick-term rounded-md border border-slate-300 bg-white px-2.5 py-0.5 font-bold text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-300 cursor-pointer" data-years="2">2 Years</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn-ln-quick-term rounded-md border border-slate-300 bg-white px-2.5 py-0.5 font-bold text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-300 cursor-pointer" data-years="3">3 Years</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn-ln-quick-term active rounded-md bg-blue-600 px-2.5 py-0.5 font-bold text-white shadow-2xs cursor-pointer" data-years="5">5 Years</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn-ln-quick-term rounded-md border border-slate-300 bg-white px-2.5 py-0.5 font-bold text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-300 cursor-pointer" data-years="7">7 Years</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ROW 2: EXTRA LOAN PAYMENTS (EXPANDABLE ACCORDION) -->
        <details class="group rounded-2xl border border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50/20 p-4 dark:border-emerald-900/60 dark:bg-emerald-950/10">
          <summary class="cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-300">
            <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span>🚀</span> Extra Loan Payments (Prepayment & Interest Savings)
            </span>
            <span class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-[11px] group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼ Expand</span>
          </summary>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3 mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-emerald-100 dark:border-emerald-900/40 text-xs">
            <div>
              <label for="inp-ln-extra-mo" class="block font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Extra Monthly Payment (₹)</label>
              <input type="number" id="inp-ln-extra-mo" value="0" step="500" min="0" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white p-2 font-bold dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-white" placeholder="0" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label for="inp-ln-extra-yr" class="block font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">Extra Annual Payment (₹)</label>
              <input type="number" id="inp-ln-extra-yr" value="0" step="5000" min="0" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white p-2 font-bold dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-white" placeholder="0" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label for="inp-ln-extra-once" class="block font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">One-Time Extra Payment (₹)</label>
              <input type="number" id="inp-ln-extra-once" value="0" step="10000" min="0" class="mt-1 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white p-2 font-bold dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-white" placeholder="0" />
            </div>
          </div>
        </details>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 pt-2">
          <button type="submit" id="btn-calc-ln" class="flex-1 rounded-xl bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-extrabold text-white shadow-lg shadow-blue-600/25 transition active:scale-[0.98] cursor-pointer">
            Calculate Loan →
          </button>
          <button type="button" id="btn-clear-ln" class="rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200 transition cursor-pointer">
            Clear All (✕)
          </button>
        </div>

        <p id="err-ln" class="hidden rounded-xl border border-red-200 bg-red-50 p-2.5 text-xs font-semibold text-red-700 dark:border-red-900/60 dark:bg-red-950/30 dark:text-red-300" role="alert" aria-live="polite"></p>

      </form>

      <!-- RESULTS PRESENTATION SECTION (Hidden Initially) -->
      <div id="ln-results-section" class="hidden mt-6 space-y-5">
        
        <!-- 1. Main Highlight Result Card -->
        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-blue-200 bg-linear-to-br from-white via-blue-50/40 to-blue-100/50 p-5 shadow-lg shadow-blue-500/5 dark:border-blue-900/60 dark:from-slate-950 dark:via-slate-900 dark:to-blue-950/30 sm:p-7">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-4 border-b border-blue-200/80 pb-4 dark:border-slate-800">
            <div>
              <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300">Estimated Monthly Loan Payment (EMI)</span>
              <div id="res-ln-monthly-emi" class="mt-1 text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400">₹ 11,122.22</div>
            </div>
            <div class="sm:text-right">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Total Interest Payable:</span>
              <div id="res-ln-total-int" class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-red-600 dark:text-red-400">₹ 1,67,333.43</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3 text-xs">
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-blue-200/60 bg-white/80 p-3 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900/70">
              <div class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-semibold">Principal Borrowed</div>
              <div id="res-ln-principal" class="mt-1 text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">₹ 5,00,000</div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-blue-200/60 bg-white/80 p-3 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900/70">
              <div class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-semibold">Annual Interest Rate</div>
              <div id="res-ln-rate-val" class="mt-1 text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">12.0% p.a.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-blue-200/60 bg-white/80 p-3 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900/70">
              <div class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-semibold">Total Amount Payable</div>
              <div id="res-ln-total-payable" class="mt-1 text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400">₹ 6,67,333</div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-blue-200/60 bg-white/80 p-3 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900/70">
              <div class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-semibold">Estimated Payoff Date</div>
              <div id="res-ln-payoff-date" class="mt-1 text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">Sep 2031</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 2. PRINCIPAL VS INTEREST RATIO CHART -->
        <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900 space-y-4">
          <h3 class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <span>📊</span> Loan Principal vs Total Interest Ratio
          </h3>

          <div class="space-y-2">
            <div class="h-4 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-slate-100 flex dark:bg-slate-800">
              <div id="bar-ln-principal" class="bg-blue-600 transition-all duration-500" style="width: 74.9%;" title="Principal Borrowed"></div>
              <div id="bar-ln-interest" class="bg-red-500 transition-all duration-500" style="width: 25.1%;" title="Interest Charged"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
              <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <span class="inline-block h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-blue-600"></span>
                <span id="lbl-chart-principal">Principal: ₹5,00,000 (74.9%)</span>
              </span>
              <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <span class="inline-block h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-red-500"></span>
                <span id="lbl-chart-interest">Total Interest: ₹1,67,333 (25.1%)</span>
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 3. EXTRA PAYMENT SAVINGS COMPARISON (When Active) -->
        <div id="card-ln-extra-comparison" class="hidden overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-emerald-200 bg-white p-5 dark:border-emerald-900/60 dark:bg-slate-900 shadow-md">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-black text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300 flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-slate-200 pb-2.5 dark:border-slate-800">
            <span>🚀</span> Prepayment Impact & Interest Savings
          </h3>
          <div class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3 text-xs">
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50/50 p-3 dark:border-emerald-900/40 dark:bg-emerald-950/20">
              <div class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Estimated Interest Saved</div>
              <div id="res-ln-int-saved" class="mt-1 text-base font-black text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">₹ 28,450</div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50/50 p-3 dark:border-emerald-900/40 dark:bg-emerald-950/20">
              <div class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Repayment Time Saved</div>
              <div id="res-ln-time-saved" class="mt-1 text-base font-black text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400">10 Months</div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-3 dark:border-slate-800">
              <div class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">New Loan Duration</div>
              <div id="res-ln-new-duration" class="mt-1 text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">4.2 Years (50 Mos)</div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-3 dark:border-slate-800">
              <div class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">New Total Interest</div>
              <div id="res-ln-new-int" class="mt-1 text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">₹ 1,38,883</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 4. AMORTIZATION SCHEDULE (YEARLY SUMMARY & MONTHLY SCHEDULE TABS) -->
        <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-3 mb-4">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <span>📅</span> Personal Loan Amortization Schedule
              </h3>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
                View yearly summary or complete monthly principal and interest schedule.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
              <!-- View Switcher Tabs -->
              <div class="inline-flex rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-100 p-1 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-800 text-xs font-bold">
                <button type="button" id="tab-ln-yearly" class="active rounded-lg bg-white px-3 py-1 text-slate-900 shadow-xs dark:bg-slate-900 dark:text-white cursor-pointer">
                  Yearly Summary
                </button>
                <button type="button" id="tab-ln-monthly" class="rounded-lg px-3 py-1 text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-400 dark:hover:text-white cursor-pointer">
                  Monthly Schedule
                </button>
              </div>

              <!-- Download PDF Button -->
              <button type="button" id="btn-ln-download-pdf" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-white shadow-xs transition active:scale-[0.98] cursor-pointer" title="Download active amortization schedule as PDF">
                <span>📄</span> <span id="txt-btn-ln-pdf">Download PDF</span>
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Schedule Table Container -->
          <div class="overflow-x-auto max-h-96 scrollbar-thin">
            <table class="w-full text-left text-xs">
              <thead id="ln-sched-thead" class="bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 font-bold sticky top-0">
                <!-- Injected dynamically -->
              </thead>
              <tbody id="ln-sched-tbody" class="divide-y divide-slate-100 dark:divide-slate-800 font-mono">
                <!-- Injected dynamically -->
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- EDUCATIONAL SEO ARTICLE SLOT (Styled matching age.astro) -->
  <Fragment slot="content">
    <section class="loan-content">
      <h2>How to Use This Personal Loan Calculator</h2>
      <p>
        Estimating your monthly installments and total borrowing costs is simple with this loan calculator:
      </p>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>Enter the loan amount:</strong> Input the principal amount you plan to borrow in Indian Rupees (₹).</li>
        <li><strong>Enter the interest rate:</strong> Input the lender's annual percentage interest rate (e.g. 12% p.a.).</li>
        <li><strong>Select loan tenure:</strong> Choose your repayment timeframe in <em>Years</em> or <em>Months</em>, or click one of the quick buttons (1Y, 2Y, 3Y, 5Y, 7Y).</li>
        <li><strong>Add optional start date:</strong> Pick the month when your first installment begins for calendar date tracking.</li>
        <li><strong>Add extra loan payments:</strong> Experiment with extra monthly, annual, or lump-sum prepayments.</li>
        <li><strong>Click Calculate Loan:</strong> Instantly view your monthly EMI, total interest payable, and total cost.</li>
        <li><strong>Examine the principal vs interest ratio bar:</strong> See how much of your repayment goes to borrowed money versus lender charges.</li>
        <li><strong>Review the Amortization Schedule:</strong> Toggle between the <em>Yearly Summary</em> and <em>Monthly Schedule</em>.</li>
        <li><strong>Download PDF:</strong> Save your active schedule as a professional PDF report.</li>
      </ol>

      <h2>Personal Loan Payment Example</h2>
      <p>
        Consider an unsecured personal loan of <strong>₹5,00,000</strong> borrowed at an interest rate of <strong>12.0% per annum</strong> for a duration of <strong>5 years (60 months)</strong>:
      </p>
      <div class="my-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900 text-xs sm:text-sm space-y-1.5 font-mono">
        <div>Principal Loan Amount (P) = ₹5,00,000</div>
        <div>Annual Interest Rate = 12% | Monthly Rate (r) = 12 / 12 / 100 = 0.01</div>
        <div>Repayment Term = 5 Years (60 Monthly Installments)</div>
        <div>Monthly Loan EMI = <strong>₹11,122.22 / month</strong></div>
        <div class="text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 font-bold">Total Interest Payable = ₹1,67,333.43</div>
        <div class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-bold">Total Amount Payable (Principal + Interest) = ₹6,67,333.43</div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 italic">
        * This example is for illustration. Actual loan payments may vary depending on lender terms, fees, repayment conditions, and other applicable charges.
      </p>

      <h2>How Interest Affects Your Personal Loan</h2>
      <p>
        Personal loans are typically unsecured loans, meaning interest rates depend heavily on your credit profile, monthly income, and employer tier:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Rate Sensitivity:</strong> Even a 1% or 2% difference in interest rate on a ₹5 Lakh loan can change your total interest cost by tens of thousands of rupees over a 5-year tenure.</li>
        <li><strong>Reducing Balance Method:</strong> Standard bank loans apply interest only on the remaining unpaid principal at the start of each monthly cycle, not on the original starting amount.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How Loan Term Affects Your Monthly Payment</h2>
      <p>
        Selecting the right loan term represents a balance between manageable monthly cash outflows and total interest:
      </p>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto my-4">
        <table class="w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-sm border-collapse border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">
          <thead class="bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-bold">
            <tr>
              <th class="p-3 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">Factor</th>
              <th class="p-3 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">Shorter Term (e.g. 2–3 Years)</th>
              <th class="p-3 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">Longer Term (e.g. 5–7 Years)</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-200 dark:divide-slate-800 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-semibold border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">Monthly EMI Payment</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">Higher monthly payment</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">Lower, more manageable monthly payment</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-semibold border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">Total Interest Paid</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">Substantially lower interest charges</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">Higher total interest accumulated over time</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-semibold border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">Debt Freedom</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">Become debt-free significantly sooner</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">Longer financial commitment</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-semibold border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">Budget Impact</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">Requires higher monthly cash flow margin</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">Leaves more room for routine household expenses</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <h2>How Extra Payments Can Affect Your Personal Loan</h2>
      <p>
        Prepaying portions of your personal loan balance accelerates debt reduction:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Direct Principal Deduction:</strong> Extra monthly or lump-sum payments directly deduct from the principal balance.</li>
        <li><strong>Interest Savings:</strong> Because interest is calculated on the reducing balance, every extra rupee paid cuts into future interest compounding.</li>
        <li><strong>Earlier Payoff Date:</strong> Shaves months or years off your final loan closure date.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How to Compare Personal Loan Offers</h2>
      <p>
        When evaluating loan quotations from different financial institutions, examine:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Annual Percentage Rate (APR):</strong> Look at the total borrowing cost including processing fees and administrative charges.</li>
        <li><strong>Processing Fees:</strong> Upfront deduction (usually 1% to 3% + GST) from the disbursed amount.</li>
        <li><strong>Prepayment / Foreclosure Charges:</strong> Verify whether the bank permits part-prepayments and what lock-in period applies.</li>
        <li><strong>Repayment Flexibility:</strong> Check for auto-debit support (NACH/e-Mandate) and grace period terms.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Estimating Payments Before Comparing Personal Loan Options</h2>
      <p>
        Borrowers commonly search for calculators and repayment tools tailored to popular lenders such as <strong>SBI personal loan calculator</strong>, <strong>HDFC personal loan calculator</strong>, <strong>ICICI personal loan calculator</strong>, <strong>Axis Bank personal loan calculator</strong>, or international institutions like <strong>Discover personal loan calculator</strong> and <strong>Navy Federal personal loan calculator</strong>.
      </p>
      <p>
        This independent calculator provides general repayment estimates using standard reducing balance mathematics. Actual interest rates, processing charges, loan terms, eligibility requirements, and repayment conditions may differ depending on the lender and individual loan sanction offer.
      </p>

      <h2>Personal Loan Calculator for India</h2>
      <p>
        In India, personal loan figures follow the standard Indian numbering system (e.g. <strong>₹1,00,000</strong>, <strong>₹5,00,000</strong>, and <strong>₹10,00,000</strong>). Leading Indian public and private sector banks generally offer personal loans ranging from ₹50,000 up to ₹40,00,000 with tenures of 1 to 7 years.
      </p>

      <h2>Personal Loan vs Other Types of Loans</h2>
      <p>
        Key distinctions between common retail borrowing products:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Personal Loan:</strong> Unsecured borrowing with no collateral requirement; higher interest rates but fast disbursement and flexible usage.</li>
        <li><strong>Home Loan:</strong> Secured by real estate collateral; lower interest rates and long 20–30 year tenures.</li>
        <li><strong>Auto Loan:</strong> Secured by the purchased vehicle; moderate interest rates with 3–7 year tenures.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Common Mistakes When Using a Personal Loan Calculator</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Focusing Only on Low Monthly EMI:</strong> Extending tenure just to achieve a small monthly payment can double your total interest cost.</li>
        <li><strong>Ignoring Processing Fees:</strong> Lenders deduct processing fees upfront, reducing your net disbursed amount.</li>
        <li><strong>Overlooking Prepayment Penalties:</strong> Failing to check if early closure triggers additional foreclosure charges.</li>
        <li><strong>Ignoring Credit Score Impact:</strong> Advertised minimum interest rates are only offered to applicants with high credit scores (750+ CIBIL/FICO).</li>
        <li><strong>Assuming Fixed Rates:</strong> Verifying whether your loan is floating or fixed interest rate.</li>
        <li><strong>Treating the Estimate as a Sanction Letter:</strong> Final loan disbursement is subject to document verification, salary slips, and underwriting approval.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Important Assumptions and Information</h2>
      <p>
        Please review these operational principles:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Standard Amortization:</strong> Monthly reducing balance compounding applied on the opening balance of each cycle.</li>
        <li><strong>Prepayment Processing:</strong> Extra payments are applied immediately toward reducing principal on the designated payment month.</li>
        <li><strong>Educational Tool:</strong> This calculator provides mathematical estimates and does not represent an official loan approval, endorsement, or financial advice.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
